{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在青海柴達木盆地的茶卡鹽湖，觀景火車在黃昏時分穿梭於「天空之鏡」，與滿月同框，勾畫溫柔暮色。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.QH.LAKE.MTV.0803-0813_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026tHlILmVncp1786584571.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.QH.LAKE.MTV.0803-0813_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T01:59:43.181289+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":46,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}